nuffs-out-startups-production-database/5224442&lt;br&gt;https://www&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/df6a19435d95ac61dba3f0859092c622b2860da1.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Match By: description,tag&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117488729786283&amp;amp;bvid=BV1SMn465E5n&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description><link>http://www.bilibili.com/video/av117488729786283</link><guid isPermaLink="false">http://www.bilibili.com/video/av117488729786283</guid><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 06:12:32 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>Muto_66</dc:creator><category>拟人</category><category>漫画</category><category>PocketOS</category><category>Claude娘</category><category>AI演绎小剧场</category><category>AI娘化</category><category>Cursor</category><category>删库</category><category>AI绘画</category><category>Q版</category><category>动画综合</category></item><item><title>十月、十一月校招怎么抢｜OC和开奖、空位从哪来、先投进库、Cursor vs Codex 三层答法</title><description>Length: 07:48&lt;br&gt;AuthorID: 3690999595403542&lt;br&gt;Play: 87    Favorite: 3&lt;br&gt;Danmaku: 0    Comment: 1&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;二七届校招最后两个月，一张纸讲清：空出来的 Head Count 从哪来，现在该做什么，被捞起来以后面试怎么答&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;章节&lt;br&gt;00:00 开场：还没上岸的同学还是有机会的&lt;br&gt;00:25 时间已经很紧了：Head Count 在收，发得更早，补录多留给晚回国的留学生&lt;br&gt;00:50 OC 和开奖：签字费、定级，十月底和十二月初两次开奖&lt;br&gt;01:33 空位是这么空出来的：两极分化，五个同学每人三个 offer 起；腾讯的排序&lt;br&gt;02:00 现在就投，先进库：最匹配的岗、面评一直留着、简历先过四样&lt;br&gt;03:14 被捞起来以后：底&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e4c18738c13d52764b790de5fd83aca63ec7b898.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Match By: title&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117485877592127&amp;amp;bvid=BV1UxnW6NEFj&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrer